{"id": "EUVD-2026-95791", "enisaUuid": "38552dfa-a8a9-3076-b0ee-f06fcc4d81e6", "description": "HortusFox (hortusfox-web) before 6.2 contains an SQL injection vulnerability that allows API token holders to inject SQL by supplying crafted include_info values to the /api/locations/list endpoint. Attackers can place subqueries in include_info, which PlantsModel::getSpecificInfo() concatenates into the column list, to read any database table including user password hashes.", "datePublished": "2026-10-09T14:08:07", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T16:04:47", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/danielbrendel/hortusfox-web/commit/c0c0f4057dd8376b63c34028de36c8c6b6288fee", "https://github.com/danielbrendel/hortusfox-web", "https://github.com/danielbrendel/hortusfox-web/security/advisories/GHSA-4w8p-x2jj-42w7", "https://github.com/danielbrendel/hortusfox-web/blob/v6.1/app/models/PlantsModel.php#L1026-L1033", "https://github.com/danielbrendel/hortusfox-web/blob/v6.1/app/controller/api.php#L642-L650", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/hortusfox-before-6.2-sql-injection-via-api-locations-list-include-info-parameter"], "aliases": ["GHSA-cwp7-9356-rvxx", "CVE-2026-108100"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "a5fed7fa-8f7a-3c0a-a70a-edb74d181519", "product": {"name": "hortusfox-web", "vendor": {"name": "danielbrendel"}}, "product_version": "0 <6.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "63f253d1-ad7e-3f36-9999-e3153bdd2d1f", "vendor": {"name": "danielbrendel"}}], "isExploited": false}